          "heading": "Jake White's Fiji assistant coaches still unannounced after his appointment this week",
          "body": "Latest reporting still has no official announcement of an assistant coaching staff under Jake White, who was appointed earlier this week and named his first 28-man squad for the Centennial Test against Japan, according to Planet Rugby. SA Rugby Magazine has reported that White is turning to a trusted Springbok ally, but no name has been confirmed by Fiji Rugby. The question stays open until the union officially names the staff."
