          "kicker": "Eligibility switch",
          "heading": "England's former lock David Ribbans becomes Springbok-eligible on 27 October",
          "body": "Former England lock David Ribbans, 11 caps for England, completes his three-year international stand-down on 27 October, opening the door to a Springbok call-up. Erasmus has said South Africa are 'looking at someone like David Ribbans', though the 31-year-old Toulon forward has previously made clear he would not take a switch lightly. He has spoken of England becoming his second home and said switching 'wouldn't be right towards England'. Eligibility, in other words, does not settle the matter."
