          "body": "Argentina's bid to stage the 2035 Rugby World Cup remains open. The Pumas lead a joint four-nation South American candidacy with Uruguay, Chile and Brazil, first presented in early October, and the decision rests with World Rugby, which has not yet named a host. Planet Rugby says the bid will challenge World Rugby's desire for a European return, while South Africa is billed as a dark horse. No outcome has been reported as of today."
